ssets/steam/apps/1521920/extras/2d1c9778326e15f3dea968ff7545cf20.webm?t=1705475082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521920/extras/2d1c9778326e15f3dea968ff7545cf20.mp4?t=1705475082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Search for treasure, explore the islands and find upgrades for your ship. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521920/extras/3116b8fa34e97b3fe7ac021f23e1d254.poster.avif?t=1705475082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521920/extras/3116b8fa34e97b3fe7ac021f23e1d254.webm?t=1705475082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1521920/extras/3116b8fa34e97b3fe7ac021f23e1d254.mp4?t=1705475082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Sell goods, grow wealthy, build a successful trade empire and conquer the world (or at least the Caribbean)!",
